Descriptor TeachingCredential
    documentation 'This descriptor defines an indication of the category of a legal document giving 
                  'authorization to perform teaching assignment services.
    with optional map type
        item Emergency
        item Intern
        item Master
        item Nonrenewable
        item Other
        item Paraprofessional
        item Professional
        item Probationary/Initial
        item Provisional
        item Regular/Standard
        item Retired
        item Specialist
        item Substitute
        item Teacher Assistant
        item Temporary